[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:05.68]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.72]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.70]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.72]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.54]One note at a time
[00:28.42]from people passing through
[00:33.42]a name beside a line
[00:38.42]and part of it is you
[00:46.42]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
